The private image_decoder AVIF RGB8 conversion is a safe Rust translation of
libyuv a0fa6329391922faca64955c1a7bf635ab87d833, pinned by Chromium
6c1d401fcca5e1b0030563a90c2f2bba168e0c15. Source functions and edge semantics
are identified in crates/image_decoder/src/avif_rgb8.rs and docs/avif-rust-backend.md.
